Code from demiurge-chain
------------------------
These are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, not under this
license. Its text is LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.

- products/arqade/tests/fixtures and docs/design/tokens.json, which are still
  carried from demiurge-chain.
- The files listed in LICENSES/from-demiurge-chain.txt, in products/qq,
  products/arqade/qt, products/arqade/games and tools/qor-media, as they stood
  on 29 October 2026, when the development of those paths moved to QOR OS
  (docs/decisions/QOR-0015-the-products-are-developed-here.md).

Changes made to those files after that, and files added to those four paths,
are licensed under this license, as section 4 of the Apache License allows
for modifications. A file from demiurge-chain changed in QOR OS says so near
its top. The exception is ARQADE's five rule modules, which ARQADE's server
shares. They are kept the same as demiurge-chain's and remain under the Apache
License as they change:

- products/arqade/games/orbital/logic/rules.mjs
- products/arqade/games/void-runner/logic/rules.mjs
- products/arqade/games/synapse/logic/rules.mjs
- products/arqade/games/rift-survivor/logic/rules.mjs
- products/arqade/games/arenas/logic/arena.mjs

QOR OS's own ARQADE games share their rules and their Node test with
ARQADE's server in the same way, and their recorded runs sit with the
fixtures above (docs/decisions/QOR-0017-arqades-new-games.md). They are
written here under the Apache License, Version 2.0, and say so in their
first line:

- products/arqade/games/rift-delve/logic/rules.mjs
- products/arqade/tests/rift-delve.test.mjs

